<sect1 id="UdpDelaySimRunner_8h_1DESCRIPTION">
<title>DESCRIPTION</title>
<para>These classes enable generation of 12 or 16 byte initialization vectors for the AES-GCM cipher per RFC9173 section 4.3.1. </para>
</sect1>
